{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34745","headline":"奉和袭美醉中即席见赠次韵 · 张贲","name":"奉和袭美醉中即席见赠次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂枝新下月中仙，学海词锋誉蔼然。\n文阵已推忠信甲，穷波犹认孝廉船。\n清标称住羊车上，俗韵惭居鹤氅前。\n共许逢蒙快弓箭，再穿杨叶在明年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}